{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ZEC","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"撒迦利亞書","commonName":"撒迦利亞書","title":"撒迦利亞書","order":38,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"596e12e88f20bda085f475cd8057e433ebcfbd7db4b18a72e7597b0902128ee5","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEC/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":211},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["金燈臺的異象"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["那與我說話的天使又來叫醒我，好像人睡覺被喚醒一樣。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["他問我說：「你看見了甚麼？」我說：「我看見了一個純金的燈臺，頂上有燈盞，燈臺上有七盞燈，每盞有七個管子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["旁邊有兩棵橄欖樹，一棵在燈盞的右邊，一棵在燈盞的左邊。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我問與我說話的天使說：「主啊，這是甚麼意思？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["與我說話的天使回答我說：「你不知道這是甚麼意思嗎？」我說：「主啊，我不知道。」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["上帝給所羅巴伯的應許"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["他對我說：「這是耶和華指示所羅巴伯的。萬軍之耶和華說：不是倚靠勢力，不是倚靠才能，乃是倚靠我的靈方能成事。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["大山哪，你算甚麼呢？在所羅巴伯面前，你必成為平地。他必搬出一塊石頭，安在殿頂上。人且大聲歡呼說：『願恩惠恩惠歸與這殿",{"noteId":5},"！』」"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["耶和華的話又臨到我說："]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["「所羅巴伯的手立了這殿的根基，他的手也必完成這工，你就知道萬軍之耶和華差遣我到你們這裏來了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["誰藐視這日的事為小呢？這七眼乃是耶和華的眼睛，遍察全地，見所羅巴伯手拿線鉈就歡喜。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["我又問天使說：「這燈臺左右的兩棵橄欖樹是甚麼意思？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["我二次問他說：「這兩根橄欖枝在兩個流出金色油的金嘴旁邊是甚麼意思？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["他對我說：「你不知道這是甚麼意思嗎？」我說：「主啊，我不知道。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["他說：「這是兩個受膏者站在普天下主的旁邊。」"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":5,"caller":"-","text":"殿：或譯石","reference":{"chapter":4,"verse":7}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEC/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEC/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEC/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}